{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d0fff84b574909aa","name":"V-19 Torrent Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-d0fff84b574909aa","title":"V-19 Torrent Starfighter","revision":18842,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:50:17Z","sha256":"318996f3377189affd382e35839b2a9ea9dc4239cbeadb3c54c9096e4c82fece","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18842","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=V-19%20Torrent%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d0fff84b574909aa","blocks":["\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["Vehicle Templates\n",{"tag":"p","children":["\n"]},"\n"],"colspan":2}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":[" Advanced Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Advanced_V-19_Torrent_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:b0b83dc5bf64ca2b"},"\n"],"colspan":2}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"br","children":[]},"\n",{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The V-19 Torrent Starfighter came into prominence at the beginning of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"}," and was the favorite ship of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"}," during the early days of the conflict. Though the ",{"tag":"a","children":["V-Wing Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/V-Wing_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:40377b32dd9b36ce"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["ARC-170 Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ARC-170_Starfighter","referenceId":"reference:fd7701de3a3d42d7"}," would later replace it, the V-19 Torrent served as a fast and agile fighter that was critical to the Republic's victory at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Muunilinst"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Muunilinst","referenceId":"reference:0997a0b4702be63c"},". The V-19 Torrent is a capable ship that draws a great deal of inspiration from folding-wing designs, such as those that would later be implemented in the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Theta"]},"-Class Shuttles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Theta-Class_Shuttles?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Lambda"]},"-Class Shuttles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lambda-Class_Shuttles"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["V-19 prototypes saw their first use at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Geonosis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Geonosis","referenceId":"reference:2f85e38b680a11c3"},", and were quickly rushed into production after that success. Though these ships were rarely seen in the first days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", by the midpoint of the war they were serving the Republic on nearly every front. Early models of the V-19 Torrent did not boast ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"}," (instead using TransGalMeg ",{"tag":"a","children":["Booster Rings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Booster_Rings?action=edit&redlink=1"},"), but a retrofit later in the war saw ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrives"}," installed in almost all of the remaining fighters.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The V-19 Torrent Starfighter is a moderately durable space superiority fighter that, while lacking shields, can take a few shots before succumbing to attrition. The Starfighter has a tough hull that allows it to last a bit longer than some future ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," (such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["TIE Fighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/TIE_Fighter","referenceId":"reference:726e84ae35ac767c"},") and is maneuverable enough to be able to avoid taking too much damage. Though the Torrent is nowhere near as capable of absorbing weapons fire as a shielded ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", the number of V-19 Torrents deployed often outweighs the losses suffered. The V-19 embodies the first steps toward the philosophy of lightly armored fighters in massive quantities that would form the core Imperial Starfighter design throughout the region of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, the V-19 Torrent Starfighter is more than adequately armed, and actually boasts armament superior to that of other contemporary ships. A pair of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missile Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missile_Launchers"}," backs up the ship's powerful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannons"},", providing a diverse weapons platform from which the Torrent can launch a variable assault. Despite their lack of shielding, V-19 Torrents can serve as adequate front-line fighters, especially when supported by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," or other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["V-19 Torrent Starfighter Statistics (CL 9)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +8; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 19 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 24; +7 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 100; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 44\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Offense"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Fly 16 Squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"},"), Fly 4 Squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Scale"],"href":"http